7 11.72 15.78L14.8 12.7C15 12.5 15.1 12.27 15.1 12C15.1 11.73 15 11.5 14.8 11.3L11.7 8.2C11.5 8 11.27 7.9 11 7.91C10.73 7.92 10.5 8.03 10.3 8.22C10.12 8.43 10.02 8.66 10.01 8.93C10 9.19 10.1 9.43 10.3 9.62L12.68 12ZM12 22C10.62 22 9.32 21.74 8.1 21.21C6.88 20.69 5.83 19.98 4.92 19.07C4.03 18.18 3.31 17.12 2.79 15.9C2.26 14.68 2 13.38 2 12C2 10.62 2.26 9.32 2.79 8.1C3.31 6.88 4.03 5.83 4.92 4.92C5.83 4.03 6.88 3.31 8.1 2.79C9.32 2.26 10.62 2 12 2C13.38 2 14.68 2.26 15.9 2.79C17.12 3.31 18.18 4.03 19.07 4.92C19.98 5.83 20.69 6.88 21.21 8.1C21.74 9.32 22 10.62 22 12C22 13.38 21.74 14.68 21.21 15.9C20.69 17.12 19.98 18.18 19.07 19.07C18.18 19.98 17.12 20.69 15.9 21.21C14.68 21.74 13.38 22 12 22ZM12 20C14.23 20 16.12 19.23 17.68 17.68C19.23 16.12 20 14.23 20 12C20 9.77 19.23 7.88 17.68 6.33C16.12 4.78 14.23 4 12 4C9.77 4 7.88 4.78 6.33 6.33C4.78 7.88 4 9.77 4 12C4 14.23 4.78 16.12 6.33 17.68C7.88 19.23 9.77 20 12 20Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></a><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="delivering-to-disabled-consumers:-doorstep-instructions" class="section-wrapper" index="3" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Delivering to disabled consumers: doorstep instructions</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’re already making it easier for people to use our services. Customers can select a number of doorstep delivery options, including:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Choosing a specific <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/safe-place" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->safe place<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Delivering to a neighbour, ParcelShop or Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Asking the courier to give you more time to get to the door<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Ringing your doorbell instead of knocking<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Making sure a parcel isn’t placed blocking a doorway or a trip hazard<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Follow the steps below for instructions on how to set your accessibility preferences. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="step-1" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAgA_My_places_Expandeddaa1.png') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAgA_My_places_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=239%2C0%2C5400%2C3591&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAgA_My_places_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=239%2C0%2C5400%2C3591&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAgA_My_places_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=239%2C0%2C5400%2C3591&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Step 1</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->To begin setting your accessibility preferences, click the link we sent you in your ‘out for delivery’ email notification, or <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/mobile-app" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->download the Evri app<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and head to the &#39;Preferences&#39; section.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="step-2" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbi4F3NbkBXAf9_AI_Menu_Expanded2926.png') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbi4F3NbkBXAf9_AI_Menu_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=192%2C0%2C5352%2C3559&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbi4F3NbkBXAf9_AI_Menu_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=192%2C0%2C5352%2C3559&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbi4F3NbkBXAf9_AI_Menu_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=192%2C0%2C5352%2C3559&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Step 2</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Select &#39;Accessibility instructions&#39; and choose one of three options; give me more time to get to the door, ring my doorbell instead of knocking or don’t block my doorway with a parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="step-3" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAf__AI_Modal_Expanded8669.png') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAf__AI_Modal_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=320%2C0%2C5352%2C3559&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAf__AI_Modal_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=320%2C0%2C5352%2C3559&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwUbjIF3NbkBXAf__AI_Modal_Expanded.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=320%2C0%2C5352%2C3559&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Step 3</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Confirm by clicking Update delivery – that’s it!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="digital-accessibility" class="section-wrapper" index="7" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_111488a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_11148.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_11148.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_11148.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older woman sits on a brown sofa. A cup of tea is resting of the arm. She is using an Ipad tablet to order a parcel on the Evri website." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Digital accessibility</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri is the first of the major UK parcel delivery companies to partner with accessiBe to promote digital inclusion and empower disabled consumers by improving accessibility of Evri&#39;s website, including tracking, delivery preferences, and booking a courier collection. The accessiBe widget can be accessed by clicking the accessibility icon, in the bottom right corner of the screen.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The website widget uses AI technology to give consumers control over their website experience. Options include a number of profiles which automatically make suggested adjustments, such as a seizure safe profile to pause all animation, a vision impaired profile to enhance visuals, adjust contrast and colour, and an ADHD friendly profile to enhance focus and reduce distractions. Other features include, keyboard navigation, text magnifier, font size adjustment alongside options such as high contrast, mute sounds and hide images.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Setting accessibility adjustments<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><ol><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Select the accessibility icon, in the bottom right corner of the screen<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Select accessibility adjustments<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Use the <!--]--><!--]--><em><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->X<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></em><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to minimise the adjustments window<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ol><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="parcelshop-and-locker-accessibility" class="section-wrapper" index="8" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Woman using terminal on parcel locker while holding cardboard box" width="5000" height="3333" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>ParcelShop and Locker accessibility</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’re making it easier for customers to find locations that meet their accessibility needs. When searching for a nearby ParcelShop or Locker using our location finder, customers can view the accessibility features available at each site before they visit.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Finding an accessible ParcelShop or Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Simply find your nearest location, select &#39;Facilities&#39;, and you’ll see details of the features available, which may include:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Accessible parking spaces<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Step-free access<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Power-assisted doors<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->This helps customers choose a ParcelShop or Locker that best suits their needs and plan their visit with confidence. As part of our ambition to become the UK’s most accessible parcel delivery company, we continue to improve the information and support available across our network.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find an Evri location" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/location-hub" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Find an Evri location<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="our-customer-service-team-is-here-to-support-you" class="section-wrapper" index="9" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpZ5bqstJ9-Wa__EVRI_LOCATION_01_05898a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpZ5bqstJ9-Wa__EVRI_LOCATION_01_0589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpZ5bqstJ9-Wa__EVRI_LOCATION_01_0589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpZ5bqstJ9-Wa__EVRI_LOCATION_01_0589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer sitting in a wheelchair is outside and a courier is handing a parcel to them with a smile. The customer is positioned to be facing away from the camera, with the courier in full view." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Our customer service team is here to support you</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our couriers understand that some customers might need additional support or more time to get to the door. If you set your delivery preferences, then your courier will be made aware of your delivery needs and will do their best to meet them. Our couriers mostly cover the same routes daily, and often get to know people well.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In addition, our customer services colleagues are trained to understand the additional needs some of our customers have and will be on hand to help you navigate any difficulties you may face.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our contact us page enables you to get help by chat or phone, whether you have problems sending or receiving parcels, or for any other issues you may be facing with your parcel delivery. You can also choose a preference of a call or email back, for queries we can’t easily resolve online.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Get help with your parcels" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/contact-us" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.