ss="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="a-courier-is-handing-a-blue-collection-receipt-to-an-older-woman-at-her-door.-blue-evri-van-visible-in-the-background." class="photo-container" index="10" data-v-b709af2f><picture data-v-b709af2f><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10228aaa9.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10228.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C1650%2C7725%2C1803&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10228.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C1650%2C7725%2C1803&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10228.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C1650%2C7725%2C1803&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door. Blue Evri van visible in the background." width="1200" height="280" class="photo-block" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-b709af2f></picture></section><section id="our-accessibility-journey-has-already-begun" class="section-wrapper" index="11" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Our accessibility journey has already begun</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have been working with the Research Institute for Disabled Consumers (RIDC) for a few years now, and with their help we have already conducted some research which helped us shape our journey so far, but we know the more people we speak to, the more developed our plans will be.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For our colleagues we launched our first workplace adjustments policy this year, as well as our inclusive language guide and are in process of setting up a number of employee networks. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Of course, there is more to be done – and there’s more to come, including a comprehensive website accessibility audit, app improvements and enhancements to our ParcelShop services. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For our colleagues and couriers, we will focus on creating a more accessible and inclusive workplace for disabled people, by fostering greater understanding of challenges and creating meaningful work opportunities.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri has been awarded silver status by the Inclusive Employers Standard and is registered as Disability Confident Committed (Level 1) by the Government&#39;s Disability Confident scheme. DCS032872.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="our-partnership-with-scope" class="section-wrapper" index="12" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwULCYF3NbkBXATM_SCOPE_SECONDARY_LOGO_FULL_COLOUR_LIGHT_RGB36bc.png') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwULCYF3NbkBXATM_SCOPE_SECONDARY_LOGO_FULL_COLOUR_LIGHT_RGB.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C2186%2C1454&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwULCYF3NbkBXATM_SCOPE_SECONDARY_LOGO_FULL_COLOUR_LIGHT_RGB.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C2186%2C1454&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZwULCYF3NbkBXATM_SCOPE_SECONDARY_LOGO_FULL_COLOUR_LIGHT_RGB.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C2186%2C1454&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Our partnership with Scope</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Scope’s vision is to help create a society where all disabled people enjoy equality and fairness.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our vision is to become the UK’s most accessible parcel delivery company.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In a genuine two-way partnership, which will last at least three years, Scope will help us on our journey to become the most accessible parcel delivery company in the UK. We at Evri are delighted with the things we’ve already achieved so far:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have fundraised more than ever before, for Scope. We surpassed our initial £125,000 commitment, reaching a £200,00 milestone through a host of different activities such as painting plant pots, climbing mountains and holding bake sales.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have launched doorstep accessibility preferences so consumers can select a number of doorstep options to give their courier instructions for a successful and comfortable delivery. More than 100,000 customers have chosen their preferences so far. You can find more information on how to set yours, below.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have supported campaigns including Scope&#39;s carol concert in December, the incredible Scope Awards in May for the second year, and Disability Pride Month in July.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We are driving awareness of Scope on our electric fleet, ParcelShop device screens, on our website and more.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We launched a quarterly listening session named the Evri Body Collective, and an insight survey with colleagues, to gain a deeper understanding from people with lived experience of disability.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have reviewed our policies to ensure best practice, and we have planned a roll out of accessibility training for colleagues. We have refreshed out brand guidelines, adding new colours to our palette to increase colour contrast and we have launched accessibility guidance for ParcelShops.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In September and October 2025, we launched a trial initiative enabling consumers to donate items via Evri’s network for free, meaning the public could drop off items for Scope at any of Evri’s ParcelShops or Lockers with Evri facilitating the delivery directly into Scope charity shops.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Together with Scope, we’re on the journey to make Evri accessible for everyone.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find out more and donate at Scope.org.uk" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="https://www.scope.org.uk/" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8